><line x1="225" y1="129" x2="225" y2="190" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="345" y1="129" x2="345" y2="190" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="225" y1="190" x2="273" y2="190" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="297" y1="190" x2="345" y2="190" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><circle cx="285" cy="190" r="12" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="285" y="190.5" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">G</text><line x1="128" y1="55" x2="46.3" y2="55" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="40,55 48.2,51.2 48.2,58.8" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/></svg>', 'A bar magnet with its north pole nearest a coil is pulled away from the coil; the coil is connected to a galvanometer.'),
('f1fe6f56-82b1-5318-bffa-d4706d48f4ce', 'f7ead7fd-7729-4ec2-9a2e-7a00cfac7c96', '4ac2239b-8226-4bfc-8116-0d8626521f30', 'a-level', '26.4', '9702 coursebook 26.4 · Lenz''s law', 9, 9, 'A student pushes a magnet 15 cm into a coil against an average magnetic repulsion of 0.20 N. How much work does the student do against the repulsion?', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.03', 'J', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'W = Fd = 0.20 × 0.15 = 0.030 J. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: W = Fd with d in m. A1: W = 0.030 J.', 2, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 420 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg2b8277f1-t fg2b8277f1-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg2b8277f1-t">Pushing a magnet into a coil</title><desc id="fg2b8277f1-d">A bar magnet is pushed towards and 15 cm into a coil connected to a galvanometer, against an average repulsive force of 0.20 N.</desc><rect x="24" y="77" width="60" height="36" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><rect x="84" y="77" width="60" height="36" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="54" y="95" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">S</text><text x="114" y="95" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">N</text><path d="M233.6,61 A6,34 0 0,0 233.6,129" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><path d="M233.6,61 A6,34 0 0,1 233.6,129" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><path d="M250.7,61 A6,34 0 0,0 250.7,129" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:roun