('5876b298-bfab-54af-b934-7dc7957329df', 'f7ead7fd-7729-4ec2-9a2e-7a00cfac7c96', '4ac2239b-8226-4bfc-8116-0d8626521f30', 'a-level', '26.4', '9702 coursebook 26.4 · Lenz''s law', 40, 40, 'A magnet is pushed into a coil of resistance 2.0 Ω, producing an e.m.f. of 0.30 V for 0.40 s. Calculate the minimum work done by the person pushing the magnet.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.018', 'J', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Electrical energy = (V²/R)t = 0.30² ÷ 2.0 × 0.40 = 0.018 J, which must be supplied as work. Mark scheme (3 marks). B1: work = electrical energy. C1: (V²/R)t. A1: W = 0.018 J.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('a69b3d2c-d9b9-5aea-aac9-9afe565b906f', 'f7ead7fd-7729-4ec2-9a2e-7a00cfac7c96', '4ac2239b-8226-4bfc-8116-0d8626521f30', 'a-level', '26.4', '9702 coursebook 26.4 · Lenz''s law', 41, 41, 'A magnet is pulled away from a coil connected in a closed circuit. What force does the coil exert on the magnet?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'An attraction, opposing the magnet''s removal', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'The induced current opposes the decrease of flux. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: oppose the change. C1: attraction. A1: C (An attraction, opposing the magnet''s removal).', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 420 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="fge12f51b0-t fge12f51b0-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fge12f51b0-t">Magnet pulled away from a coil</title><desc id="fge12f51b0-d">A bar magnet is pulled away from a coil that is part of a closed circuit with a galvanometer.</desc><rect x="24" y="77" width="60" height="36" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><rect x="84" y="77" width="60" height="36" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="54" y="95" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">S</text><text x="114" y="95" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">N</text><path d="M233.6,61 A6,34 0 0,0 233.6,129" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><path d="M233.6,61 A6,34 0 0,1 233.6,129" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><path d="M250.7,61 A6,34 0 0,0 250.7,129" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#